ar before arriving between terms.","short_summary":"See rotating and collection-based art in Gustavus’s free campus museum.","evidence_claim":"Gustavus states that admission to the Hillstrom Museum of Art, including receptions and special events, is free and open to the public.","source_url":"https://news.blog.gustavus.edu/2014/09/10/hillstrom-museum-opens-season-with-pull-left-not-always-right/","source_title":"Hillstrom Museum Opens Season with Pull Left–Not Always Right","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2014-09-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to the public; hours and exhibition availability vary, especially between exhibitions and when classes are not in session.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-peter-community-center-walking-track","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Saint Peter Community Center Walking Track","title":"Walk Indoor Laps","subtitle":"Saint Peter Community Center","notes":"Bring clean walking shoes and set a shared lap goal; strollers, walkers, and wheelchairs are also welcomed on the indoor track.","short_summary":"Use the city’s indoor track for a weather-proof, no-fee walk.","evidence_claim":"Saint Peter’s 2026 community brochure says the Community Center walking track is free and open to anyone during regular business hours.","source_url":"https://www.saintpetermn.gov/DocumentCenter/View/4507","source_title":"Saint Peter Community Brochure 2026","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free and open to anyone during regular Community Center business hours; clean walking shoes are required.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"saint-peter-public-library-program","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Saint Peter Public Library Program","title":"Join a Free Library Progra